Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/kvunoff/whoisthat

Package: whoisthat
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, iproute2, nftables, libcap2-bin
Recommends: polkitd | policykit-1
Description: Modern terminal-based VPN client with Xray-core backend
 WhoisThat is a terminal UI and CLI that drives a local Xray-core daemon
 over IPC. Proxy and TUN modes, split tunneling, routing and an encrypted
 profile database are included.
